verdict: PASS
blockers: none
adversarial_criteria:
- invariant: Adding author approvals or repeated approval entries to an already admissible candidate must not veto admission or make approval ordering significant.
  positive_witness: With all checks true and author ann, approvals ann,bob,bob,cy,ann print ADMIT and exit 0, as does the reversed sequence.
  negative_control: An implementation that rejects the entire candidate upon encountering a self-approval or repeated reviewer prints REJECT for either sequence and must fail this criterion.
  observable: Compare stdout and process exit status for CLI invocations using both approval sequences.
  boundary: CLI entry of scripts/gate.ts reading candidate JSON files.
END-REVIEW-TRAILER
```

